{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8a834079dabe1e90","name":"Rebel Vanguard","source":{"id":"source:reference-8a834079dabe1e90","title":"Rebel Vanguard","revision":25831,"timestamp":"2024-12-24T11:39:36Z","sha256":"44caf29540b4e545325cfbaa9801e2d75097707adc46518fd72efa80f66eb53a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25831","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rebel%20Vanguard&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8a834079dabe1e90","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," SpecForce command structure, the 6th Regiment houses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapon"}," specialists who operate the blaster emplacements, missile launchers, and other heavy-hitters that specialize in turning Imperial war machines into scrap metal. These regiments only exist on paper, of course- SpecForce units are composed of troopers of many types drawn from the various specialties (pathfinders, technicians, marines, and so on). When assigned to a task force during a mission, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapon"}," specialists are more commonly called \"Gunners\" (if they specialize in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blasters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blasters"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},") or \"Vanguards\" (if they specialize in shoulder-fired ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missile Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missile_Launchers"},", making them the first to contact enemy mechanized units).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Vanguards face some unique challenges. Once they launch their first missile, they usually have to seek cover immediately to avoid being taken out by enemy fire. Once in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Cover"},", they can take the time to reload their projectile launchers, but they must be ready to sling the massive weapon over their shoulder and switch to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," if their position is compromised by enemy infantry.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Obviously, this situation won't remain winnable for long; having only a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," to use against enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"}," usually results in a quick death. Fortunately, Vanguards carry plenty of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenades"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["HX2 Antipersonnel Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/HX2_Antipersonnel_Mines"}," to buy time against advancing enemies, so they can usually make it back to a friendly unit or hold out long enough for allied infantry to provide some support.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Rebel Vanguard Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Human"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f